      "story_intro": "蛋蛋在晨露花园的晨光中苏醒，村长手把手教他合成与建塔。村口小径来了零散的脚步声，正好用单体塔和减速塔练手，凑出三星组合。",
      "story_intro_en": "Eggy wakes in Morning Dew Garden as the village chief teaches merging and tower building. Scattered crawlers wander up the path, perfect for practicing single target and slowing towers toward a three star combo.",
      "story_outro": "晨露未散，花园守住了，蛋蛋第一次明白了合成的乐趣。",
      "story_outro_en": "The garden holds, and Eggy learns the joy of merging."
    },
