      "story_intro": "离开花园，蛋蛋走进荆棘林地，错位的路口让布塔更要动脑。空中传来振翅声，地面还有会分裂的小家伙，村长提醒他留好对空火力。",
      "story_intro_en": "Eggy enters Bramble Woods where the offset crossing demands smarter placement. Fliers buzz overhead while splitters waddle below, so the chief urges him to save anti air firepower.",
      "story_outro": "林地安静下来，蛋蛋学会了对空与补位，分裂怪也不再可怕。",
      "story_outro_en": "The woods fall quiet, and Eggy masters anti air and cleanup."
